TITLE	Zesty Soup
INGREDIENT	section-header	Soup:
INGREDIENT	item	1 cup water
INGREDIENT	item	1 cup water
INGREDIENT	section-header	Seasoning
INGREDIENT	item	1/2 tsp salt	fixture-a
INGREDIENT	item	2 cups broth
INGREDIENT	item	1-2 cloves garlic
INGREDIENT	item	1 (14-oz) can beans
